Z||000006||84Bill||05-01-2001||11:33 PM||||You have sail panels on that puppy? drove me positivly insane for a month till I replace a cracked one on the P side. Apparently the sail pannel was a bit loose (not much)and had enough play to get singning when the air got under it.  Test it by putting Duck (QUACK) Tape all the way around the pannel<P><p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 05-02-2001).]||||reg||3
